<title>USA: Abraxas buys Enserch Green River wells.</title>
<headline>Abraxas buys Enserch Green River wells.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abraxas Petroleum Corp said Tuesday it closed the acquisition of natural gas producing properties in Wyoming's Green River Basin from Enserch Exploration Inc for $47.5 million.</p>
<p>The properties produced an average of about 869 barrels of oil and natural gas liquids and 12.8 million cubic feet of natural gas daily net to Abraxas' interest during the first half of the year, resulting in revenues of $4.9 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
